    "description": "DISCLAIMER:\nYOU ARE ENCOURAGED TO READ EVERYTHING BELOW BEFORE BIDDING OR PURCHASING ANY ITEM:\nNational Geographic Hobby Rock Tumbler\nDescription:\nA gray motorized base unit featuring a simple digital timer panel with a single black rolling barrel mounted on top.\nUse:\nUsed for tumbling, smoothing, and polishing rough stones into shiny gemstones.\nCondition:\nThe mechanical base unit is labeled as \"Powers ON Works\". However, the lid on the black container barrel does not seal properly, which can cause water and grit mixtures to leak during operation.\nEarth's Code Advanced Professional Rock Tumbler\nDescription:\nA black motorized base unit featuring dual digital control knobs for days and speed settings with red LED readouts, holding a black rolling barrel tilted slightly on its side.\nUse:\nUsed for advanced lapidary rock polishing with multiple custom speed and timer settings.\nCondition:\nThe electrical base unit is marked with a note stating \"Powers ON Works\". Similar to the other unit, the lid on its tumbling container does not seal properly, creating a leakage issue during use.\nAssorted Rough Rocks\nDescription:\nA loose collection of unpolished, raw geological stones spread across the table surface in front of the machines. The collection includes varying translucent greens, purples, and gray-veined minerals.\nUse:\nIntended to be placed inside the tumbling barrels along with water and polishing grit to be transformed into smooth gemstones.\nCondition:\nRaw, unpolished, and structurally intact.\nIF ITEM (EX. CLOCK OR WATCH) IS STATED AS RUNNING AT THE TIME OF POSTING, WE CANNOT GUARANTEE THAT THE ITEM WILL BE IN WORKING OR RUNNING CONDITION WHEN IT IS RECEIVED. WE DO NOT KNOW IF ITEM WAS DAMAGED AND WILL CONTINUE TO WORK, EVEN AFTER A SHORT TEST. THE ITEM IS USED/DONATED, AND IF THE ITEM IS NOT WORKING CORRECTLY AT THE TIME IT IS RECEIVED, THE ITEM MAY NEED BATTERIES/REPAIR.\nNOTE: IF YOU ARE PURCHASING A SEWING MACHINE THAT HAS A PLASTIC CASE/COVER, WE WILL NOT PAY FOR ANY DAMAGE DURING SHIPPING DUE TO THE NATURE OF THE PLASTIC. THE PLASTIC - IF ON AN OLDER SEWING MACHINE - IS FRAGILE AND CAN BE DAMAGED WITH MINOR PRESSURE, NO MATTER HOW WELL THIS IS PACKAGED. PLEASE TAKE NOTE OF THIS FOR CLAIM PURPOSES.\nUNLESS THE DESCRIPTION OR TITLE STATES AUTHENTICATED, WE DO NOT MAKE ANY CLAIMS THAT A SIGNATURE IS AUTHENTIC ON AN ITEM YOU ARE PURCHASING. IT MAY BE A COPIED SIGNATURE.\nITEMS ARE LISTED IN OVERALL GENTLY USED CONDITION\nPHOTOS ARE USED AS PART OF THE ITEM'S DESCRIPTION\nWE TRY OUR BEST TO CHECK FOR DEFECTS OR EXCESSIVE WEAR, BUT THEY ARE MISSED ON OCCASSION. WITH THIS IN MIND, WE ARE SELLING THE ITEM \"AS IS\". ALL SALES ARE FINAL!\n*THANK YOU SO MUCH FOR SHOPPING ON SHOPGOODWILL.COM AND SUPPORTING OUR MISSION TO SUPPORT PERSONS WITH DISABILITIES AND OTHER BARRIERS TO INDEPENDENCE IN ACHIEVING THEIR FULLEST POTENTIAL AS WORKERS AND AS MEMBERS OF THE BROADER COMMUNITY.",
